        "Content": "<ul><li> Detached 4-Bedroom Bungalow Spacious single-storey accommodation extending to approx. 106.9 sq. m.</li><li> Exceptional Coastal Location Just minutes' walk from Blackrock seafront, promenade and beach.</li><li> Prime Village Convenience Schools, park, cafés, Centra and local amenities all within easy walking distance.</li><li> Excellent Potential A genuine blank canvas with scope to modernise and create a home to your own taste.</li><li> Ideal Family Home Four bedrooms, two bathrooms, separate living and dining rooms, with oil-fired central heating.</ul>"
